      "content": "I'm reviewing a claim for a warehouse fire in Rotterdam involving a shipment of industrial solvents. Can you provide a technical breakdown of the primary risk factors associated with storing highly flammable liquid solvents in high-density pallet racking systems? I need to focus on thermal runaway, ventilation constraints, and the efficacy of standard suppression systems in this specific configuration.",
